{"hymn":"S340","parent":"E441","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"A Jesús le rindo todo","subtitle":"Consagración—Rendirlo todo al Señor","syl":{"n1":"A","n2":["Je","i"],"n3":["sús","t"],"n4":"le","n5":["rin","i"],"n6":["do","t"],"n7":["to","i"],"n8":["do,","t"],"n9":["To","i"],"n10":["do‿a","t"],"n11":"Él","n12":["con","i"],"n13":["fia","m"],"n14":["do","t"],"n15":"doy;","n16":["Vi","i"],"n17":["vi","m"],"n18":["ré","t"],"n19":"en","n20":"Su","n21":["pre","i"],"n22":["sen","m"],"n23":["cia,","t"],"n24":["O","i"],"n25":["fre","m"],"n26":["cién","m"],"n27":["do","m"],"n28":["le","t"],"n29":["mi‿a","i"],"n30":["mor.","t"],"n31":"Yo","n32":"me","n33":["rin","i"],"n34":["do‿a","t"],"n35":"Él,","n37":"Yo","n38":"me","n39":["rin","i"],"n40":["do‿a","t"],"n41":"Él,","n43":["To","i"],"n44":["do‿a","t"],"n45":["Cris","i"],"n46":["to","t"],"n47":"yo","n48":["me‿en","i"],"n49":["tre","m"],"n50":["go,","t"],"n51":"Yo","n52":"me","n53":["rin","i"],"n54":["do","t"],"n55":"a‿Él."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["A Jesús le rindo todo,","A Sus pies postrado estoy;","Los placeres he dejado,","Y le sigo desde hoy."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["A Jesús le rindo todo,","Hazme Tuyo, mi Señor;","Que Tu Espíritu me toque,","Te haga real en mi interior."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["A Jesús le rindo todo,","Hoy me entregó a Ti, Señor;","Que Tu bendición me alcance,","Y el poder de Tu amor."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["A Jesús le rindo todo,","Siento el santo fuego hoy;","Plena salvación yo gozo,","Y a Su Nombre doy loor."]}]}